==Event Information==
Third Impact threatens the Cat Empire! The {{Color|#FF0000|'''EVANGELION'''}} and "The Battle Cats" Crossover Event is here!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''April 17th (11am) through May 1st, 2018!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of your favorite Evangelion characters in this special crossover Rare Capsule set!
These awesome units are only available during this collab event, so don't miss out!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''You might collect...'''}}

[[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Eva Unit-00 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angels & Floating, and negates Wave attacks! Area attacks gain increased damage and defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-01 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#AA33CC|'''Eva Unit-01 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong versus Alien & Zombie enemies! Area attacks power up as it takes damage, and destroys Barriers! Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Eva Unit-02 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-Range Area strikes and massive damage vs Red enemies!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Shinji Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Shinji Cat (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Knocks back Metal & Black with area-effect Wave Attacks!<br>
[[Moon Operators (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Moon Operators (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks slow Red & Zombies! Plus, kills Zombies permanently and prevents them from reviving!<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Rei Ayanami (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might weaken Angels!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Asuka Langley (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Asuka Langley (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Red Enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Mari Illustrious (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Rei Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Rei Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|''','''}} [[Asuka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Asuka Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|''','''}} [[Mari Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mari Cat'''}}]] {{Color|#FF0000|'''(Rare)'''}}<br>
Awesome limited edition Cat versions of the Evangelion heroes!

<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the Evangelion collab units from the Evangelion capsule set. Evangelion units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the Evangelion capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If Evangelion Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Face off against terrifying collab-only enemies with your army of Evangelion characters!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Stages "Evangelion Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collaboration to test your Cats at Evangelion collab stages!<br>
Clear the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Evangelion Activates!"'''}} stage for a change to receive the collab unit [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Shinji & Cat'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Shinji & Cat! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
Clearing "Decisive Battle!" will earn you huge XP rewards!<br>
<small><small>※Activate Shinji & Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Blitz Stages! Defend Tokyo-3 Against the Angels!'''}}<br>
The collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}} with extra-tough stages will be available at the times listed below! Can you smash the cruel Angels and hold off Third Impact?<br>
・'''Odd Dates (4/17, 4/19, 4/21, 4/23, 4/25, 4/27, 4/29)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Even Dates (4/18, 4/20, 4/22, 4/24, 4/26, 4/28, 4/30)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Last Collab Date (5/1)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the limited edition collab character [[Giraffe Unit-01 (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Giraffe Unit-01! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
<small><small>※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・After Day 5, challenge the Ultimate Refusal Type Angel!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From the 5th day of the collab, (4/22)'''}}, the collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!<br>
・'''Even Dates (4/22, 4/24, 4/26, 4/28, 4/30)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Odd Dates (4/23, 4/25, 4/27, 4/29)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}<br>
・'''Last Collab Date (5/1)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the True Form of limited edition collab character [[Kaworu & Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Kaworu & Cat'''}}]]! Can you conquer these super-tough stages and pick up Kaworu's 3rd form?<br>
<small><small>※Upgrade Kaworu & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Kaworu & Cat!<br>
※Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Kaworu & Cat.</small></small>

<div style="background-color: var(--color-min-contrast);border: solid 2px red;border-radius: 6px;padding-inline: 1rem;">
※NOTICE※<br>
Kaworu & Cat is a bonus reward unit that is planned to be delivered to all players in the 2nd half of the Collab Event if the conditions of the Battle Cats-Evanglion social media event are met. If "The 10th Angel Strikes!" is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may pick up the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.
</div>

Plus, get a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''first-time clear reward of 30 Cat Food'''}} when you achieve victory on all stages on any of these maps!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Evangelion events!<br>
<small><small>※Evangelion Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until May 1st, 2018 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!</small></small>

*{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Half-off Energy Costs for Stories of Legend during this event!'''}}<br>
Conquer the ultimate Battle Cats challenge in the Stories of Legend!<br>
During the times below, all yellow {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Stories of Legend'''}} stages will cost just {{Color|#FF0000|'''half their normal energy'''}} requirement!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・7:00am ～ 8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・12:00pm ～ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・7:00pm ～ 8:59pm'''}}

Don't miss this awesome opportunity to clear tons of Stories of Legend stages!<br>
<small><small>※ Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to access the Stories of Legend.<br>
※ This half-off energy event does not apply to Special Stages and Collaboration Stages.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Treasure Festivals Available!'''}}<br>
At certain times during this event, get a higher drop rate for stage clear rewards! Don't miss out on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Festival'''}}!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''Even Days (4/18, 4/20, 4/22, 4/24, 4/26, 4/28, 4/30)'''}} get this bonus at {{Color|#008000|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Odd Days (4/17, 4/19, 4/21, 4/23, 4/25, 4/27, 4/29, 5/1)'''}} get this bonus at {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Into the Future'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#335599|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} Treasure Fest is available on {{Color|#335599|'''4/19, 4/22, 4/25, 4/28, 5/1!'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards! Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the Special Collab Unit "[[Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats (Special Cat)|Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats]]"<br>
Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Once received, you can unlock "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.</small></small>

For more information on Evangelion, visit<br>
http://www.evangelion.co.jp/

